\title{tennelo: Elo Ratings for Tennis}
\description{
Computes Elo ratings from ATP match results, overall and by playing surface. Provides the rating primitives (expected score, experience-dependent K-factor, rating update) as pure, vectorised functions, so that the update rule can be tested exactly. Two pairing rules are supported: separate K-factors per player, matching the convention used by published tennis Elo lists, and a single symmetric match K-factor that conserves the rating pool.
